      "created_at": "2018-04-26T20:19:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"rjc917\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/48/1888_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> rjc917:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is it safe to assume it'll be easy for people to recognize you to get one of these cards?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I hope so. Ten cloaks were purchased in bulk to be given out, orgionally I was just going to wear one of those, but to stand out more and because they didn't turn out to be quite as good as I was hoping I am going to try to get a better cloak for myself</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
